## Invoice Reconciliation Configuration

### Materiality Threshold
Invoices below this value: two-way match acceptable (no GR required)
Threshold: £[X] (default recommendation: £500)

### Tolerance Rules by Category

| Category | Price Tolerance | Quantity Tolerance | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Direct materials | ±[X]% | ±0% | Zero quantity tolerance |
| Indirect / MRO | ±[X]% | ±[X]% | |
| Services | ±0% | N/A | Must match PO exactly |
| Freight / logistics | ±[X]% | N/A | Fuel surcharge variability |
| Utilities | ±[X]% | N/A | Tariff variability |
| [Other category] | ±[X]% | ±[X]% | |

### Auto-Approve Rules
Auto-approve if: all lines matched within tolerance AND total < £[X]
Auto-approve if: price variance within tolerance AND GR confirmed

### Escalation Thresholds
Price variance requiring Category Manager approval: > [X]% or > £[X]
Price variance requiring CPO approval:             > [X]% or > £[X]
Total disputed amount requiring Finance Director:  > £[X]

### Auto-Reject Rules (no exceptions)
- Duplicate invoice (same vendor, same amount, within [X] days)
- Invoice > [X] days old (late submission — default: 90 days)
- Vendor not on approved vendor list and value > £[X]
- Bank detail change detected (→ fraud escalation; never auto-reject alone)

### Exception Pattern Threshold
Same exception type from same vendor:  > [X] times in 30 days = systematic issue
Price variance on same item:           > [X] consecutive invoices = CAR required

### Payment Terms (default by vendor tier)
Strategic (Tier 1):  Net [X] days (default: 45)
Tactical (Tier 2):   Net [X] days (default: 30)
Commodity (Tier 3):  Net [X] days (default: 30)
Early payment:       [X]% discount for payment within [X] days (if offered)

