## Vendor Risk Configuration

### Risk Thresholds — Strategic (Tier 1) Vendors

Financial:
  Credit rating downgrade:         IMMEDIATE CPO escalation
  Restructuring news:              IMMEDIATE CPO brief within 48 hours
  Revenue decline > [X]%:          Flag for category manager review
  Accounts overdue filing:         Flag for category manager; request information

Operational:
  OTD < [X]%:    Corrective Action Request within 5 business days
  OTD < [X]%:    Contingency plan activated (default thresholds: <90% CAR; <80% contingency)
  Quality > [X]%: CAR within 5 days
  Quality > [X]%: Immediate supply hold; root cause required (default: >2% CAR; >5% hold)

### Risk Thresholds — Bottleneck (Tier 4) Vendors

Same operational thresholds as Tier 1 PLUS:
  Any negative financial signal:   Immediate brief — no alternative exists
  Any Tier 2 supply chain signal:  Immediate brief — no buffer

